## Why This Is Asked

Feature flags and canary rollouts are common in production, but testing them across regions with multi-tenant overrides is tricky. This question probes how you design end-to-end tests, ensure isolation, observe, and roll back safely.

## Key Concepts

- Feature flag resolution with per-user and per-tenant overrides
- Canary rollout across multiple regions
- Observability: traces, metrics, and logs
- Rollback safety and data isolation

